WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.596 --> 00:00:09.636
Open the dossier of the right type, in a project you opened yourself.

2
00:00:09.636 --> 00:00:14.149
Click “Add” to enter an expense.

3
00:00:14.149 --> 00:00:23.637
Describe the expense: what was paid, when and where.

4
00:00:23.637 --> 00:00:34.728
Amount in the country's currency; otherwise open “Paid in another currency”.

5
00:00:34.728 --> 00:00:41.576
A team and a responsible manager are required to submit: choose the manager.

6
00:00:41.576 --> 00:00:52.066
Click “Save”: the line stays a draft that only you can edit.
